------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Data attribution
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The deck shipped with this application — the Qur'anic verses (Arabic text),
their Persian translation, and the recitation audio — is data extracted from
the public export quran-cards-2026-10-14.apkg, whose contents come from:

    https://quran.makarem.ir/

No other source is used for the card data. That data belongs to its source
above and is not itself licensed under the MIT terms above; it is included
solely as attributed content. The typefaces bundled in assets/fonts/ carry
their own open licenses (see the OFL files beside them).

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Algorithm attribution
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The scheduling algorithm used by this application is a port of Anki's SM-2
review scheduler (itself derived from the classic SuperMemo-2 algorithm),
including Anki's deck defaults, ease adjustments, learning steps, lapse
handling, interval fuzzing and review queue. Anki is licensed under the GNU
AGPLv3; this project ships an independent reimplementation of the algorithm's
math (no Anki source code is included) and is not affiliated with or endorsed
by the Anki project. See https://apps.ankiweb.net/ for the original.
